    {
      "id": "claim_ccccbada95ff4eddaa845f75e2ebe4f9",
      "statement": "Runnables expose schema introspection via InputType/OutputType properties and input_schema/output_schema properties returning Pydantic models for validation and tooling. get_input_jsonschema() and get_output_jsonschema() return JSON Schema representations suitable for API documentation and OpenAPI integration. config_schema() returns schema for configurable fields.",
