    {
      "id": "claim_a944944208c64ce981660e4589371ca1",
      "statement": "Binding methods (bind, with_config, with_types, with_listeners, with_alisteners, with_fallbacks, with_retry) return new Runnables with bound arguments, configuration, type overrides, or lifecycle handlers. These enable composable modification without mutation. bind() passes static arguments not in chain output; with_config() binds tags/metadata/callbacks; with_listeners() binds on_start/on_end/on_error callbacks.",
