    {
      "id": "claim_66b9f220aedf4ed9a7270fcd48ba158f",
      "statement": "RunnableLambda wraps Python callables into Runnables, automatically detecting async callables for native async support. If lambda returns a Runnable, that runnable is automatically invoked. Input/output types inferred from function signature for schema introspection. Separate afunc parameter can provide async implementation.",
