    {
      "id": "claim_22bd774c7fe04151b0beb5998e892fbd",
      "statement": "coerce_to_runnable(thing) converts any RunnableLike (Runnable, Callable, Generator, AsyncGenerator, Mapping) into a Runnable. Callables become RunnableLambda, generators/async generators become RunnableGenerator, dicts become RunnableParallel, Runnables pass through. Enables natural composition: prompt | my_function | {\"field\": another_function}.",
