    {
      "id": "claim_8b807fdc8de949ffac96196a7ea32805",
      "statement": "Design invariant: All Runnables implement uniform interface with sync/async variants for all operations, single-input/batch operations sharing semantics, and streaming following same composition patterns. Single chain works in sync, async, batch, and streaming contexts without modification. Composition immutably returns new Runnables without mutation. Execution is lazy (composition doesn't execute).",
